    "text": "Let $d\\geq 3$, and let $f_d(n)$ be the minimal $m$ such that every set of $n$ points in $\\mathbb{R}^d$ determines at least $m$ distinct distances. Estimate $f_d(n)$ - in particular, is it true that $ f_d(n)=n^{\\frac{2}{d}-o(1)}? $ ",
